Error [jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed]: `items` cannot be changed by calling `add` while `window` is still looking into it
  --> tests/ui/ownership/lambda_write_conflicts_with_live_view.jet:9:5
    |
  9 |     add(4)
    |     ^^^
 Why: `window` is a live read view into `items[…]`; changing or moving the owner could invalidate that view
 Fix: Finish using `window` before changing `items`, narrow the view's scope, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212
